{{--
    One <symbol> per icon the vote page repeats on every card, emitted once
    per page. Cards draw them with <svg><use href="#icon-…"/></svg> instead
    of each carrying its own copy of the path (#180). The paths are
    Heroicons, as Flux renders them: outline thumbs, and the solid 20 px trash Flux uses on a small square button.
--}}
